#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:46
msgid "Hotspot: %1"
msgstr "热点：%1"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:50
msgid "Normal mode (Wi-Fi disconnected, NIC as AP)"
msgstr "普通模式（断开 Wi-Fi，网卡当 AP）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:51
msgid "Concurrent mode (Wi-Fi stays connected)"
msgstr "并发模式（保持 Wi-Fi 连接）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:76
msgctxt "@label wifi row"
msgid "Wi-Fi"
msgstr "Wi-Fi"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:83
msgid "Not connected (normal mode occupies the NIC)"
msgstr "未连接（普通模式占用网卡时需断开）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:84
msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "未连接"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:90
msgid "Hotspot"
msgstr "热点"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:97
#: plasmoid/contents/ui/main.qml:114
msgid "%1 device"
msgid_plural "%1 devices"
msgstr[0] "%1 台设备"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:101
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "开机自启"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:104
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:104
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "已启用"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:117
msgid ""
"⚠ The config is not readable by your user, so the mode/name/password shown "
"here are defaults. Re-run install.sh (or add your user to the network group) "
"to fix."
msgstr ""
"⚠ 当前用户读不到配置文件，这里显示的模式/名称/密码都是默认值。重跑 install.sh"
"（或把用户加入网络管理组）即可修复。"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:129
msgid ""
"⚠ Wireless interface %1 not found — check STA_IF in /etc/kde-hotspot/config "
"(the hotspot would just sit in standby)."
msgstr ""
"⚠ 未找到无线接口 %1 — 请检查 /etc/kde-hotspot/config 里的 STA_IF（否则热点只"
"会一直待命）。"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:141
msgid ""
"⚠ 5GHz was refused by the hardware, the hotspot fell back to 2.4GHz. Wi-Fi "
"moved to 2.4G; the band preference is restored when the hotspot is turned "
"off."
msgstr ""
"⚠ 固件不支持 5GHz 热点，已自动回退到 2.4GHz。Wi-Fi 已切换至 2.4G，关闭热点后"
"自动恢复原频段。"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:154
msgid ""
"⚠ The hotspot is beaconing but DHCP (dnsmasq) is not running, so clients "
"will connect but get no IP address. Check journalctl -u kde-hotspot-dhcp."
msgstr ""
"⚠ 热点已在发信标，但 DHCP（dnsmasq）没在运行：客户端能连上却拿不到 IP 地址。"
"请查看 journalctl -u kde-hotspot-dhcp。"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:164
msgid ""
"⚠ Normal mode: turning on the hotspot disconnects the current Wi-Fi (uplink "
"then relies on wired network)"
msgstr "⚠ 普通模式：开启热点会断开当前 Wi-Fi 连接（此后设备上网依赖有线网络）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:176
msgid "Running…"
msgstr "执行中…"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:176
#: plasmoid/contents/ui/main.qml:53
msgid "Starting hotspot…"
msgstr "正在开启热点…"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:177
msgid "Starting hotspot… (click to cancel)"
msgstr "正在开启热点…（点击可取消）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:178
msgid "Turn off hotspot"
msgstr "关闭热点"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:178
msgid "Turn on hotspot"
msgstr "开启热点"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:188
msgid "Hotspot mode"
msgstr "热点模式"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:195
msgid "Concurrent (Wi-Fi stays on, hotspot follows the Wi-Fi channel)"
msgstr "并发模式（Wi-Fi 不断，热点跟随 Wi-Fi 信道）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:203
msgid "Normal (disconnect Wi-Fi, whole NIC as hotspot)"
msgstr "普通模式（断开 Wi-Fi，网卡整体做热点）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:212
msgid "Autostart hotspot at boot"
msgstr "开机自动启用热点"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:223
msgid "Hotspot name & password"
msgstr "热点名称与密码"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:234
msgid "Current password"
msgstr "当前密码"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:237
msgid "(not set)"
msgstr "（未设置）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:242
msgid "Hide password"
msgstr "隐藏密码"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:242
msgid "Show password"
msgstr "显示密码"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:252
msgid "Hotspot name (1-32 characters)"
msgstr "热点名称（1-32 字符）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:261
msgid "New password (8-63 characters, empty = keep password)"
msgstr "新密码（8-63 字符，留空则只改名称）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:270
msgid "Apply name/password"
msgstr "应用名称/密码"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:284
msgid ""
"When the hotspot is running it restarts automatically to apply the change "
"(connected devices must reconnect)."
msgstr ""
"热点正在运行时，保存后会自动重启热点让新名称/密码生效（已连接的设备需要重"
"连）。"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:297
msgid "Dependencies: all ready ✓"
msgstr "依赖检查：全部就绪 ✓"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:298
msgid "Dependencies: %1 missing ⚠"
msgstr "依赖检查：缺少 %1 项 ⚠"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:302
msgid "Recheck"
msgstr "重新检查"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:330
msgid ""
"Fix commands (one auth prompt; package installs are deliberately not "
"password-free)"
msgstr "修复命令（会弹一次授权框；系统包安装刻意不纳入免密授权）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:349
msgid "Copy commands"
msgstr "复制上面的命令"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/FullRepresentation.qml:354
msgid "Commands copied to clipboard"
msgstr "命令已复制到剪贴板"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:11
msgid "Show band/channel next to the tray icon"
msgstr "在托盘图标旁显示频段/信道"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:18
msgid "Status refresh interval (seconds)"
msgstr "状态刷新间隔（秒）"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/configGeneral.qml:23
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Tip: concurrent mode keeps Wi-Fi connected (the hotspot follows the Wi-Fi "
"channel; it falls back to 2.4GHz if the hardware refuses 5GHz); normal mode "
"disconnects Wi-Fi and uses the whole NIC as the hotspot."
msgstr ""
"提示：并发模式保持 Wi-Fi 连接（热点在 2.4GHz 同信道）；普通模式会断开 Wi-Fi，"
"把网卡整体当热点用。"

#: plasmoid/contents/ui/main.qml:51
